  "title": "Lazy Longanisa (Filipino-Style Breakfast Sausage)",
  "description": "Kielbasa sausage is marinated in sugar and soy sauce then cooked until caramelized in this lazy longanisa recipe for a Filipino-style breakfast dish.",
